    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yoabu mutabane wa Zeruia yaakitegeera nga kyabazinga Daudi omwoyo gumulumira mutabane we Abusalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Yoabu yaayetesa omukazi omugezigezi, baamuleeta okuva e Tekoa. Yaamukoba ati: “Weekoze obe ng'oti n'omuntu afiiriirwa, weesibe ekikaakaati, era olobe kwesiigaku kazigo naire obeere irala ng'omuntu amaze entangama ng'alira omufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo ni oje ye kyabazinga omukobe oti n'oti.” Agho Yoabu yaakobera omukazi bye yali aja okukoba kyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale omukazi oyo yaaja yaatuuka ye kyabazinga, yaakuba amakiryaivu era yaakutama n'ekyeni kyatuuka ku itaka. Yaakoba kyabazinga ati: “Isebantu kyabazinga, mbeera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga yaamubuuza ati: “Kiki ky'oyenda nkukolere?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi yaamwiramu ati: “Wo, nze ndi namwandu, baze yafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era nze omwiru wo omukazi nali ni batabane bange babiri, baasoolera eyo mu nsiko nga ghazira anaabagaya, owundi yaakuba mwine yaamwita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mperaano ab'endhu ya iseibwe boonaboona bantanwireku olutalo, nze omwiru wo omukazi, nga bakoba bati, ‘Tughe omusaadha oyo eyaita muganda we tumwite, twesasuuze olwa muganda we ye yaita.’ Bwe bakola ekyo, banaaba nga bazikiriiza n'eyandibaire omusika yeena. Olwo nze bandeke nga nziraku mwana, era bazikirize baze abuleku yaawoniagho naire, eriina lye balisaaniegho ku nsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga yaakoba omukazi ati: “Irayo ewuwo ndidha kulagira ensonga dho badhikoleku.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi yaakoba kyabazinga ati: “Isebantu kyabazinga, omusango ka gubenga ku nze ni ku b'endhu ya lata wange, aye iwe n'ab'omu kisaagaati kyo eky'obwakyazinga batabangaku musango naire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga yaamukoba ati: “Omuntu yeenayeena bw'akutiisatiisa mundeetere ghano, taidha kwirayo kukudaaza kabiri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi yaakoba ati: “Nkweghemba Isebantu kyabazinga, osabe Musengwa Katonda wo, alobere oyo ayenda okwesasuuza olw'ole ye baita, alobe kweyongera kwita. Olwo mutabane wange awone okuzikirizibwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga yaamukoba ati: “Ndayira Musengwa Katonda omulamu, nti mutabane wo tibaidha kumutuusaaku kabi waire akatono kati.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi yaakoba kyabazinga ati: “Nkusaba nze omwiru wo omukazi, ndhogereyo ekibono ekindi eri iwe Isebantu kyabazinga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga yaamukoba ati: “Yogera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi yaakoba ati: “Kale lwaki otegeike okukola abantu ba Katonda ekibi ekyo? Mu ekyo ky'ova okusalagho, Isebantu kyabazinga, oba oli kwesalira mwene omusango okukusinga, bw'oloba okweta mutabane wo ye wali obinze, aire eka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twenatwena tuja kufa, era tuli ng'oti maadhi agayuyiike ku itaka omuntu g'atasobola kuyoolagho kabiri. Aye Katonda taja kutwala bulamu bwa muntu ali kusala amagezi ag'okwiza oyo ye baabinga ali kudaagiradaagira eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni, Isebantu kyabazinga, nze omwiru wo omukazi ndidhie okukukobera ebintu ebyo, kuba abantu bantiisiisatiisiisa. Naakoba mule nti, ‘Ka nje ndhogere ni kyabazinga. Kisoboka okuba nga kyabazinga anaakola nze kye nnaamusaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aidha kuwulira kye nkoba, amponie nze oyo ayenda okutuzikiriza nze ni mutabane wange, tuve ku butaka bwaife obw'ensikirano Katonda bwe yatugha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era nze omwiru wo omukazi, naakoba mule nti, ‘Ekibono musengwa wange kyabazinga ky'anankoba, kiidha kundeetera okuguma omwoyo’ kuba iwe musengwa wange kyabazinga oli nga malaika wa Katonda, okwawula ekirungi n'ekibi. Musengwa Katonda wo abenga n'iwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
